{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft &amp; Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft you race with freedom and creativity! Make your own vehicles, characters and tracks by combining simple shapes together without any restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly configure your race as you want: the decorations, power-ups, moving obstacles and let's go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to race? Go! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/Crafty_Gif_1.gif?t=1742021001\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform stunts, push, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win tracks and models. Race as much as you want with endless fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Race solo or up to 4 players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split Screen local multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/Crafty_Gif_2_Race_in_Local_Multiplayer.gif?t=1742021001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft your racing tracks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/Crafty_Gif_22.gif?t=1742021001\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edit existing tracks or create new ones from scratch in any theme (cars, beach, bedroom, workshop, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add jumps, decorations, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use funny models as checkpoints and direction signs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft your characters and opponents!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/Crafty_Gif_3_Craft_Character.gif?t=1742021001\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft your Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/Crafty_Gif_4_Craft_Vehicle.gif?t=1742021001\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from classic options like karts, buggies, racing cars, and trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or go for funnier ones like a bath vehicle, a sofa car, or a tiger rover. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist now and try the Demo!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the Wishlist button now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the demo and let me know any ideas!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2637080?t=1742021001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2637080?t=1742021001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/b45435b2e18eea6bb2d9a08009a6725a52756f01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742021001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/b45435b2e18eea6bb2d9a08009a6725a52756f01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742021001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3235780,"description":""}